            "review_title": "Review at Truong Nguyen",
            "review_text": "Tom V\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam122 contributions\n0\nRelaxing Luxury Coffee Experiene\nNov 2015 • Friends\nNestled beneath a huge shade tree behind Diamond Plaza department store Truong Nguyen's flagship store is a relaxing place to try authentic Vietnamese coffee. Choose from aircon light filled room or sit outside next to one of the many flowing water features. Service is prompt and the staff have good English. The coffee is real and tasty. Advetnrous? Try the 'Weasel' coffee and ask about it's story.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 9, 2015",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
