            "review_text": "Ekristanti\nAmsterdam, The Netherlands111 contributions\n0\nWell known Vietnamese coffee...\nDec 2011\nI like the branch that is near to Diamond Plaza (District 1) with its garden. There are indoor & outdoor areas either for smokers or non-smokers. What else to order other than Vietnamese iced coffee with milk or ca phe sua da. For breakfast, I like the two sunny side up eggs served with warm baguette, coriander leaves & soy sauce.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 23, 2011",
